        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87307821?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarified that the align-items: stretch will also shrink the cross axis in section align-items: stretch.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Since the previous description was a little incomplete so this will help readers clarify the use of align-items: stretch in a more clear fashion that overflowing items will be shrunk.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Source:<br>\n<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/align-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/align-items</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39491.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3058023589\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39491\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39491/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39491\">#39491</a></p>\n",
