            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR replaces a handful of the existing \"Test your skills\" sections in the learning area with embedded scrims. This is an experiment, the aim of which is to share what this might look like. and get some early feedback.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The eventual aim would be to provide interactive tests, to hopefully give users a better experience than the historic assessments we've had in the learn area.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39917",
            "title": "Add experimental Scrimba skill test embeds to learn area",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-20T17:53:19.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-12T14:57:06.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39200.\">fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3006794889\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39200\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39200/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39200\">#39200</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If not read carefully, one may not realize that the placeholder for the alpha channel is <code class=\"notranslate\">alpha</code> and not <code class=\"notranslate\">a</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The PR</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>sprinkles <code class=\"notranslate\">alpha</code> keywords wherever possible</li>\n<li>adds a whole example about manipulating the alpha channel using the <code class=\"notranslate\">calc()</code> function</li>\n<li>Increase the heights of some live samples to avoid vertical scrollbars</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39913",
            "title": "css(update): add usages of 'alpha' placeholder in relative colors doc",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-19T04:30:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-12T11:08:51.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "OnkarRuikar",
                "url": "https://github.com/OnkarRuikar"
