            "date_published": "2025-06-11T16:10:46.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ashish-2106",
                "url": "https://github.com/ashish-2106"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">webNavigation</code> event <code class=\"notranslate\">details</code> properties that are only available in Chrome.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To align with the updated BCD. This was updated to clarify that these properties are not available in Firefox after feedback in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3083917505\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39630\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39630/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39630\">#39630</a>. This change also makes the documentation more complete.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39630.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3083917505\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39630\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39630/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39630\">#39630</a><br>\n\"<strong>Depends on:</strong> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"748116350\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/123\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/123/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/123\">#123</a>\"  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3129006388\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27012\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27012/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27012\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27012</a></p>",
